==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[smart ass]]
* [[smart arse]] {{qualifier|UK, AU, NZ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# {{slang}} One who is particularly [[insolent]], who tends to make [[snide]] remarks or jokes.
#: ''Lots of luck, '''smartass'''.''

====Synonyms====
* [[smart aleck]]
* [[smart-aleck]]
* [[smart alec]]
* [[smart-alec]]

Synonyms of smart ass are not the same as a synonym of smart alec. Smart alec's do not mean to be rude while a smart ass will carry it on to the next level.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{slang}} Related to or characteristic of a smartass.
#: ''I have had quite enough of your '''smartass''' remarks.''

